{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Float and build your city in the clouds.</strong> <br><i>Skyscraper Tiles</i> is a calm and creative city builder where your only limit is the sky. Stack futuristic skyscrapers high above the clouds and fill the air with gentle streams of flying vehicles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561040/extras/af6c40fb61023e5a7e595f996d93ee85.poster.avif?t=1769462319\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561040/extras/af6c40fb61023e5a7e595f996d93ee85.webm?t=1769462319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561040/extras/af6c40fb61023e5a7e595f996d93ee85.mp4?t=1769462319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No timers. No stress. Just soothing vibes and satisfying building as you shape your perfect skyline, one tile at a time. Whether you're unwinding after a long day or getting lost in your imagination, this is your peaceful escape to a world above the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561040/extras/03cee2dcd342ee0d9d5926db94a621e6.poster.avif?t=1769462319\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561040/extras/03cee2dcd342ee0d9d5926db94a621e6.webm?t=1769462319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561040/extras/03cee2dcd342ee0d9d5926db94a621e6.mp4?t=1769462319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf06 <i>Create Soaring Skylines</i> \u2013 Build sky-high cities with a serene futuristic style.<br>\ud83d\ude81 <i>Watch It Come Alive</i> \u2013 Populate your city with graceful flying vehicles.  <br>\ud83c\udfb5 <i>Peaceful Soundscape</i> \u2013 Chill music and soft visuals for maximum relaxation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sit back, take a deep breath, and start building the skyline of your dreams. <i>Skyscraper Tiles</i> is your cozy corner in the clouds.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3561040?t=1769462319","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3561040?t=1769462319","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561040/52117731c67af1ee8de36513961972290c6be14e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769462319","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561040/52117731c67af1ee8de36513961972290c6be14e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769462319","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Float and build your city in the clouds.</strong> <br><i>Skyscraper Tiles</i> is a calm and creative city builder where your only limit is the sky. Stack futuristic skyscrapers high above the clouds and fill the air with gentle streams of flying vehicles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561040/extras/af6c40fb61023e5a7e595f996d93ee85.poster.avif?t=1769462319\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561040/extras/af6c40fb61023e5a7e595f996d93ee85.webm?t=1769462319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561040/extras/af6c40fb61023e5a7e595f996d93ee85.mp4?t=1769462319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No timers. No stress. Just soothing vibes and satisfying building as you shape your perfect skyline, one tile at a time. Whether you're unwinding after a long day or getting lost in your imagination, this is your peaceful escape to a world above the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561040/extras/03cee2dcd342ee0d9d5926db94a621e6.poster.avif?t=1769462319\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561040/extras/03cee2dcd342ee0d9d5926db94a621e6.webm?t=1769462319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561040/extras/03cee2dcd342ee0d9d5926db94a621e6.mp4?t=1769462319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf06 <i>Create Soaring Skylines</i> \u2013 Build sky-high cities with a serene futuristic style.<br>\ud83d\ude81 <i>Watch It Come Alive</i> \u2013 Populate your city with graceful flying vehicles.  <br>\ud83c\udfb5 <i>Peaceful Soundscape</i> \u2013 Chill music and soft visuals for maximum relaxation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sit back, take a deep breath, and start building the skyline of your dreams. <i>Skyscraper Tiles</i> is your cozy corner in the clouds.</p>","developers":["Super Voxel Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561040/95715d583a43ebc0b3de8f8bb3fff46880e29d68/header.jpg?t=1769462319","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</s